,"url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#ci","content":"Bazel jobs restore disk/repo cache via `.github/actions/setup-bazel` (keyed on `MODULE.bazel.lock` + `.bazelversion`)."},"123":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-121","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#published-lab-images-ghcr","content":"`.github/workflows/publish-images.yml` builds first-party CPU-portable images and publishes them to `ghcr.io/<owner>/<repo>/<id>` on push to `development` / `main`. Pull requests build both architectures (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`) with `type=cacheonly` and do **not** push. Catalog: `.github/container-images.json`."},"124":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-122","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#published-lab-images-ghcr","content":"Image id"},"125":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-123","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#published-lab-images-ghcr","content":"Local tag (unchanged)"},"126":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-124","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#published-lab-images-ghcr","content":"GHCR tags"},"127":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-125","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#published-lab-images-ghcr","content":"`lab-dashboard`"},"128":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-126","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#published-lab-images-ghcr","content":"`lab-dashboard:local`"},"129":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-127","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WI