,"contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#ide-settings-workspace","content":"Container-only interpreter paths (`python.defaultInterpreterPath`, mypy\ninterpreter) live in `.devcontainer/devcontainer.json` so host macOS/Windows\ncheckouts are not forced onto Linux paths."},"441":{"id":"/dev-environment-119","page_id":"/dev-environment","tags":["devcontainer","contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#without-a-container-host-tools","content":"Prefer the container for parity. If you must work on the host:"},"442":{"id":"/dev-environment-120","page_id":"/dev-environment","tags":["devcontainer","contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#without-a-container-host-tools","content":"Linux CI-style lint install (amd64 **and** arm64):"},"443":{"id":"/dev-environment-121","page_id":"/dev-environment","tags":["devcontainer","contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#without-a-container-host-tools","content":"Then install &#x2A;*Node 22+** and run `cd dashboard && npm ci`, plus `docs/setup-docs.sh` for the docs site."},"444":{"id":"/dev-environment-122","page_id":"/dev-environment","tags":["devcontainer","contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#without-a-container-host-tools","content":"On **Windows**, use WSL2 Ubuntu and either the devcontainer or the Linux host path above—not native PowerShell for Bazel/lint."},"445":{"id":"/dev-environment-123","page_id":"/dev-environment","tags":["devcontainer","contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#troubleshooting","content":"Symptom"},"446":{"id":"/dev-environment-124","page_id":"/dev-environment","tags":["devcontainer","contributing","bazel","onboarding","multi-arch"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-environment#troubleshooting","content":"Fix"},"447":{"id":"/dev-environme