44","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"GitHub-only"},"841":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-45","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Why not mirrored"},"842":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-46","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/workflows/deploy-docs.yml`"},"843":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-47","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Fumadocs static export → GitHub Pages (`gh-pages`, `.nojekyll`). Needs a chosen Gitea Pages / static host + secrets before a Gitea equivalent exists."},"844":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-48","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/workflows/publish-images.yml`"},"845":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-49","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Digest-then-manifest publish to GHCR (`GITHUB_TOKEN` + `packages: write`). Gitea has no GHCR; keep building `lab-*:local` on the node until a registry is chosen."},"846":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-50","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"`.github/dependabot.yml`"},"847":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-51","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Dependabot is a GitHub product; use Renovate or manual bumps on Gitea. On GitHub it must open PRs against `development` (`target-branch`), not `main`. Enforced by `tests/bats/tooling.bats`."},"848":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-52","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#intentional-non-parity","content":"Docker Buildx still uses `cache-from/to: type=gha` for structural parity with GitHub. On pure `gitea-act-runner` hosts the GHA cache backend may no-op; prefer a persistent local Docker layer cache or registry cache on the runner if rebuilds stay cold."},"849":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-53","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Runner labels may differ (configure in Gitea)."},"850":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-54","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Secrets and variables are configured in Gitea UI (use the same logical names where applicable)."},"851":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-55","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"For self-hosted, ensure docker or the execution environment has the tools Bazel and hermetic dashboard tests need."},"852":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-56","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Caching: mount persistent volumes for Bazel disk/repo caches; use `actions/cache` for npm/pip/Playwright when supported."},"853":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-57","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Docs **publish** stays on GitHub Pages unless you add a separate Gitea deplo